flowchart LR
    U[Authenticated user] --> F[Django RAG Planner form]
    F --> V[Input validation and protected view]
    V --> E[MPNet query embedding]
    E --> S[Cosine search over cached hybrid-chunk vectors]
    S --> K[Top 3 retrieved chunks]
    K --> G{Best similarity at least 0.35?}
    G -- No --> A[Grounded abstention and warning]
    G -- Yes --> P[System instruction plus context plus query]
    P --> Q[Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct]
    Q --> O[Output schema and completion validation]
    O --> R[Django result page]
    A --> R
    R --> D[Answer, sources, scores, warning, and latency]
